<title>ITALY: Italian bank bad loans rise 1.02 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Italian bank bad loans rise 1.02 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bad loans in the Italian banking system rose 1.02 percent to 117.410 trillion in April from 116.223 trillion in March, latest Bank of Italy figures showed.</p>
<p>On a year-on-year basis, bad loans rose 3.84 percent from 113.060 trillion in April 1996. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
